#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog, abstracted circuit function and application function services designed to accelerate research and application prototyping."
msgstr "I-explore ang IBM Qiskit Functions Catalog, mga abstracted na circuit function at application function service na dinisenyo para pabilisin ang pananaliksik at pagbuo ng prototype ng aplikasyon."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Functions"
msgstr "Panimula sa Qiskit Functions"

